nting the ordering note, consistent with the work-packages/overview route comment at line 273.", "AC5 — Frontend chunk-first strategy: renderWorkPackageDetail() issues Promise.all([getChunks(...).catch(() => []), getDialogues(...)]) in parallel. When chunks.length > 0, useChunks=true and entries=chunks; otherwise falls back to dialogues. data-use-chunks='1'/'0' attribute on each button drives getChunkRendered vs getDialogueContent on click. Silent catch on getChunks handles older projects without a chunks/ directory gracefully.", "Regression: full test suite (59 test files, 1795 tests) passed with 0 failures. No regressions introduced."], "duration_s": 181.0}
